        <activityName xml:lang="en">Heat pump, brine-water, 50kW</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Heat pump, brine-water, 50kW
Inventory for the production of a brine-water heat pump, 50kW with a life time of 20 years.;
Synonyms: Wärmepumpe mit Wärmetauscher Sole/ Wasser 50kW; 
UUID: 12bff562-96a8-3efe-b1dc-94ee21490e0e
All material inputs for the heat pump and coolant, share of Infrastructure for the production of the heat pump and also the energy use for producing the heat pump.  The Infrastructure for a borehole heat exchanger needs to be added if it is part of the system.
Location: Data apply to the supply in Switzerland.
Technology: Industry data.
Time period: undefined
Production volume: na
Sampling: Data provided by manufacturer 
Extrapolations: &lt;null&gt;
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_12bff562-96a8-3efe-b1dc-94ee21490e0e.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
